        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66798?u=080c44d1d79722d715d9bfc3d0f488a40286c1a7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/a#strong_link_text\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessibility / Strong link text</a> example header to fix duplicated content in the EmbedLiveSample.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This also makes the header consistent with the weak example, which is \"Inaccessible, weak link text\".</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Link:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Example HTML:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;p&gt;Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;/products&quot;&gt;about our products&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;p&gt;Learn more &lt;a href=\"/products\"&gt;about our products&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Displayed example:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Learn more about our products <a href=\"https://44e1d5f9b44daf128070b2aca959480c668bebc5.mdnplay.dev/products\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Learn more <a href=\"https://44e1d5f9b44daf128070b2aca959480c668bebc5.mdnplay.dev/products\" rel=\"nofollow\">about our products</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
