        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120456655?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adding examples, correcting texts, adding links and various contributions to improve the overall quality of the documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These changes enhance clarity, fix minor issues, and provide useful code snippets and references to help readers better understand the content.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Includes grammar fixes, added code examples, a new relevant link, and general content improvements.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>",
